OL,5,G1800 Antiques Roadshow
OL,6,     FErddig 1: Fiona Bruce and the team
OL,7,     Fof antiques experts visit Erddig,
OL,8,     Fnorth Wales, where items include a
OL,9,     Fdazzling emerald and diamond ring
OL,10,     Fworn by the owner's grandmother on
OL,11,     Fthe Titanic.
OL,12,G1900 Tropic of Cancer with Simon Reeve
OL,13,     FMexico to the Bahamas: Simon Reeve
OL,14,     Ftraces the path of the northern
OL,15,     Ftropic around the globe. He begins
OL,16,     Fin Mexico before heading east to
OL,17,     FCuba and finishing in the Bahamas.
